{"span": "src:43c0b3d5fae6#p1.1", "text": "The planning of the exercise was appropriate for the established objectives (section level night fire training) and the simulated tactical scenario. The planning and subsequent conduct of the live fire exercise was entirely consistent with established regulations and coordination procedures, as directed by the CF and the Commander of TF Rakkasan."}
